OL,3,GNEWSAMum felt 'ashamed' as she
OL,4,Astruggled to bond with baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says she felt "ashamed" after
OL,7,Ffeeling "completely detached" to her
OL,8,Fnewborn son following his birth four
OL,9,Fyears ago.
OL,11,FMichaela from Wigan was suffering from
OL,12,Fpost-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD)
OL,13,Fafter four miscarriages and a still
OL,14,Fbirth before her son was born in 2022.
OL,16,F"I just felt disbelief, like he wasn't
OL,17,Fmine. I couldn't make it add up that it
OL,18,Fcould be OK," Michaela said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
