OL,3,GNEWSAMum felt 'ashamed' as she
OL,4,Astruggled to bond with baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichaela eventually received help from
OL,7,Fthe Building Attachments and Bonds
OL,8,FSupport service (BABS), run by Greater
OL,9,FManchester Mental Health NHS Trust,
OL,10,Fwhich works to connect mothers with
OL,11,Ftheir young children.
